,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":18214,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1927,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["airflow","apache","apache-airflow","automation","dag","data-engineering","data-integration","data-orchestrator","data-pipelines","data-science","elt","etl","machine-learning","mlops","orchestration","python","scheduler","workflow","workflow-engine","workflow-orchestration"],"visibility":"public","forks":18214,"open_issues":1927,"watchers":47308,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/pulls/70517","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/70517","diff_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/70517.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/70517.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-24T11:43:37Z"},"body":"Adds a \\`[metrics] statsd_socket_path\\` option so Airflow can submit metrics over a Unix Domain Socket instead of host/port — for both the StatsD and DataDog backends.\n\nToday \\`get_statsd_logger\\` / \\`get_dogstatsd_logger\\` only pass \\`statsd_host\\` / \\`statsd_port\\`, so deployments that expose the daemon over a UDS — e.g. the Datadog Kubernetes operator, which mounts a socket and sets \\`DD_DOGSTATSD_URL=unix:///var/run/datadog/dsd.socket\\` — have no way to use it from Airflow. Both \\`datadog.DogStatsd\\` and the \\`statsd\\` library (\\`UnixSocketStatsClient\\`) support a socket path; this exposes it through Airflow config.\n\n\\`statsd_host\\` and \\`statsd_port\\` keep their existing defaults (\\`localhost\\` / \\`8125\\`). When \\`statsd_socket_path\\` is set it takes precedence and host/port are ignored:\n- **DataDog backend** (\\`statsd_datadog_enabled = True\\`): builds \\`DogStatsd(socket_path=...)\\`. Accepts a plain path or a \\`unix://\\` / \\`unixgram://\\` / \\`unixstream://\\` URL.\n- **StatsD backend**: builds \\`statsd.UnixSocketStatsClient\\` instead of the UDP \\`StatsClient\\`. Expects a plain filesystem path.\n\nWhen \\`statsd_socket_path\\` is unset, behavior is identical to before.\n\n- New \\`[metrics] statsd_socket_path\\` config key (\\`default: ~\\`).\n- \\`get_dogstatsd_logger\\` and \\`get_statsd_logger\\` (shared) gain a \\`socket_path\\` kwarg; when set, the socket-capable client is selected automatically.\n- airflow-core and task-sdk wrappers read the new key and select \\`UnixSocketStatsClient\\` / pass \\`socket_path\\` to \\`DogStatsd\\` when it is set.\n- Unit tests covering socket_path passthrough for both backends.\n\nCloses #70666\n\n---\n\n##### Was generative AI tooling used to co-author this PR?\n\n- [X] Yes — Claude Code (Opus 4.8 1M)\n\nGenerated-by: Claude Code (Opus 4.8 1M) following [the guidelines](https://github.com/apache/airflow/blob/main/contributing-docs/05_pull_requests.rst#gen-ai-assisted-contributions)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/70517/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/70517/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":28647247244,"node_id":"LE_lADOAgUK288AAAABKnLcjc8AAAAGq4JNjA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/events/28647247244","actor":{"login":"dosubot[bot]","id":131922026,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOB9z4ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/324583?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dosubot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.c